A telehealth weight-management clinic in Indonesia. Patient and lead conversations arrive over
WhatsApp and Instagram, and every one was answered by a person. The goal was to lower that load
and answer outside working hours, with consultation bookings as the measure of success.

Private company code, so this describes design and measured results — no links, excerpts,
prompts, clinical rules, prices or knowledge-base content.

